1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 6=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:51,079 --> 00:01:52,879
I don't want
to bear Young Master's child.

7
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:54,719
What about you?

8
00:01:57,920 --> 00:01:59,079
Why don't you want to?

9
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:01,920
My mother told me

10
00:02:02,488 --> 00:02:03,920
I must never become a concubine.

11
00:02:04,599 --> 00:02:06,640
If I marry, I should marry properly

12
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,159
and become a lawful wife.

13
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,080
Even if life is hard,

14
00:02:10,152 --> 00:02:12,080
as long as husband
and wife talk things through,

15
00:02:12,120 --> 00:02:13,640
they can still live happily together.

16
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,879
Lanxiang,

17
00:02:16,319 --> 00:02:18,120
don't bear Young Master's child either.

18
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:19,639
My grandmother told me

19
00:02:19,960 --> 00:02:21,599
women like us, with no proper status,

20
00:02:21,599 --> 00:02:23,039
are bound to come to a bad end.

21
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:26,199
I don't want to come to a bad end.

22
00:02:26,599 --> 00:02:27,520
In this residence,

23
00:02:28,080 --> 00:02:29,680
you're my favorite person.

24
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,439
I don't want you
to come to a bad end, either.

25
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:36,840
All right.

26
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:38,719
Don't cry.

27
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:44,800
Maybe Young Master
won't even take a liking to us.

28
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,319
Really?

29
00:02:50,759 --> 00:02:53,919
You think Young Master won't like us?

30
00:02:58,479 --> 00:02:59,520
Then from now on,

31
00:02:59,599 --> 00:03:00,690
I won't slack off anymore.

32
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:03,032
I'll kowtow to the Bodhisattva
three times every day.

33
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,039
No.

34
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:06,280
Six times. Three more for you.

35
00:03:06,290 --> 00:03:07,950
I'll pray that
the Bodhisattva blesses us

36
00:03:08,008 --> 00:03:10,120
so Young Master won't take
a liking to either of us.

37
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:11,416
I'll kowtow three more times

38
00:03:11,448 --> 00:03:13,520
and pray that the Bodhisattva
blesses Young Madam

39
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:14,280
with a child soon.

40
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,560
I don't really like Young Madam,

41
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:19,159
but if she has a child,

42
00:03:19,319 --> 00:03:21,240
we won't have
to bear Young Master's children.

43
00:03:25,039 --> 00:03:26,080
Lanxiang,

44
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,400
what are you laughing at?

45
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,240
You remind me

46
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:35,879
of a girl I knew in the capital.

47
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,960
Her name also had
the character "Lian" in it.

48
00:03:41,319 --> 00:03:43,000
The capital?

49
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:45,199
Isn't that really far away?

50
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:47,360
It must be hard to see her again, right?

51
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:53,960
Very far away.

52
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,680
I'll never see her again.

53
00:04:06,159 --> 00:04:06,960
Someday,

54
00:04:10,719 --> 00:04:12,840
you might have a chance
to go to the capital.

55
00:04:13,919 --> 00:04:14,560
Maybe

56
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,879
we'll both get the chance.

57
00:04:37,192 --> 00:04:39,256
I heard you've been
promoted to second-class maids.

58
00:04:44,232 --> 00:04:45,070
Congratulations.

59
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,879
Young Madam is very strict.

60
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,839
I'm a little scared

61
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,240
to serve her directly.

62
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,240
You and Lanxiang

63
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:25,399
aren't the type to stir up trouble.

64
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,240
Just be careful.

65
00:05:27,288 --> 00:05:28,700
No matter how strict Young Madam is,

66
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,920
she can't punish someone

67
00:05:30,079 --> 00:05:31,240
for no reason.

68
00:05:35,319 --> 00:05:36,439
Do you think

69
00:05:37,639 --> 00:05:40,759
Ji'er really stole the ring?

70
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:46,920
Lanxiang,

71
00:05:47,399 --> 00:05:48,240
what do you think?

72
00:05:49,639 --> 00:05:51,560
You and Ji'er grew up together

73
00:05:51,560 --> 00:05:52,936
in the same servants' quarters.

74
00:05:58,552 --> 00:05:59,310
(Eating in secret.)

75
00:05:59,752 --> 00:06:00,950
(Don't let those two see.)

76
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:07,639
I don't know
what happened with the ring.

77
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,240
Ji'er is very competitive.

78
00:06:12,904 --> 00:06:14,430
She always wants to come out on top.

79
00:06:15,816 --> 00:06:17,290
Even when hanging out clothes to dry,

80
00:06:17,319 --> 00:06:18,879
she has to get a better spot than me.

81
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:23,439
But in the six years we lived together,

82
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:27,879
she never stole so much
as a needle or thread from anyone.

83
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,879
My mother said
that when serving our masters,

84
00:06:43,950 --> 00:06:45,416
we must stay sharp and observant,

85
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:46,759
and be quick on our feet.

86
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,040
Listen to what we should,

87
00:06:48,070 --> 00:06:49,736
and ignore everything we shouldn't hear.

88
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,600
Don't say anything we shouldn't.

89
00:06:51,620 --> 00:06:53,128
And even when we should say something,

90
00:06:53,576 --> 00:06:55,240
it's better not to if we can help it.

91
00:07:00,279 --> 00:07:01,040
Please, Yingge,

92
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:02,319
say that again slowly.

93
00:07:02,376 --> 00:07:03,190
I didn't understand.

94
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,319
Don't make me repeat myself.

95
00:07:05,439 --> 00:07:07,079
Just say it one last time.

96
00:07:10,959 --> 00:07:12,160
I'll show you an easy way.

97
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,879
Just follow Lanxiang's lead.

98
00:07:21,079 --> 00:07:22,040
Lanxiang,

99
00:07:22,040 --> 00:07:23,519
I'll follow you from now on.

100
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:28,759
Why are you clinging
to me like a little kitten?

101
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:37,879
I'm barely able to look after myself.

102
00:07:38,439 --> 00:07:39,800
If you don't mind,

103
00:07:40,279 --> 00:07:41,319
then follow me.

104
00:07:46,399 --> 00:07:48,079
Only puppies wag their tails.

105
00:07:49,839 --> 00:07:52,680
She doesn't care
if it smells good or bad,

106
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,600
as long as it works.

107
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,120
Don't bite me.

108
00:08:01,519 --> 00:08:03,040
Bite me again and I'll tickle you.

109
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,490
My mother says that in our courtyard,

110
00:08:04,500 --> 00:08:06,120
I'm the best at barking like a dog.

111
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,879
Does it sound real?

112
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:26,560
The air is dry.

113
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:28,680
Beware of fire.

114
00:08:31,240 --> 00:08:32,440
These are for Lanxiang.

115
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:36,240
The jacket, shoes,
and socks are all ready.

116
00:08:37,759 --> 00:08:38,639
Let me see.

117
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:44,080
It's getting colder by the day.

118
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:47,480
Still no word from her?

119
00:08:52,039 --> 00:08:53,200
It's all because I'm useless.

120
00:08:53,679 --> 00:08:54,960
I spent the money,

121
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:57,240
but couldn't find anyone to help.

122
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:00,279
You can't

123
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,519
blame yourself for that.

124
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:05,600
After all, she's
in Young Madam's courtyard.

125
00:09:17,159 --> 00:09:18,200
Who is it?

126
00:09:24,632 --> 00:09:27,208
(Chen Cuizhu, Du Xiaolian's Mother)
Are you Lanxiang's father?

127
00:09:28,399 --> 00:09:29,480
I'm Xiaolian's mother.

128
00:09:32,080 --> 00:09:34,080
Our daughters
entered the residence together.

129
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:34,559
Yes.

130
00:09:34,559 --> 00:09:35,559
Come in.

131
00:09:35,759 --> 00:09:36,799
Please, come in.

132
00:09:39,399 --> 00:09:40,159
Madam.

133
00:09:40,559 --> 00:09:41,600
Please, have a seat.

134
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,279
Sit down.

135
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:44,440
I'll just say a few words
and be on my way.

136
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:48,360
I heard you're looking

137
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:51,120
for someone
who can enter the inner residence.

138
00:09:55,519 --> 00:09:56,279
Yes.

139
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:59,360
Our daughter Lanxiang
entered the residence,

140
00:09:59,919 --> 00:10:01,360
and we can't help worrying about her.

141
00:10:01,559 --> 00:10:04,240
So we wanted to find someone
who could pass along a message

142
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,600
or pass along a handkerchief,

143
00:10:05,879 --> 00:10:07,240
just so we know she's all right.

144
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,240
Yes.

145
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,679
I'm a night-soil collector.

146
00:10:11,279 --> 00:10:12,559
Before dawn every morning,

147
00:10:12,679 --> 00:10:15,000
I go to each courtyard
to collect the night soil.

148
00:10:16,519 --> 00:10:18,000
If you don't mind...

149
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:23,879
Not at all.

150
00:10:23,919 --> 00:10:24,919
Not at all.

151
00:10:25,240 --> 00:10:26,080
That's wonderful.

152
00:10:26,120 --> 00:10:26,720
Yes.

153
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:28,639
Right.

154
00:10:30,279 --> 00:10:33,039
These are the shoes I made
for my daughter Lanxiang,

155
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:33,919
and the socks,

156
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,639
and a newly sewn jacket.

157
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:37,879
Thank you.

158
00:10:37,919 --> 00:10:38,360
All right.

159
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:40,960
You haven't even had a sip of water.

160
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:41,799
Next time.

161
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:44,879
Another day,

162
00:10:45,039 --> 00:10:46,960
I'll come and thank you in person.

163
00:10:47,399 --> 00:10:49,120
I'll make a few dishes
and bring them over

164
00:10:49,159 --> 00:10:50,559
for you to try.

165
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:51,240
Oh, please,

166
00:10:51,279 --> 00:10:53,240
don't say that.

167
00:10:53,559 --> 00:10:54,799
Xiaolian told us

168
00:10:54,919 --> 00:10:57,320
Lanxiang has always looked out for her.

169
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:59,440
Our daughters were meant to meet,

170
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:01,279
and so were our two families.

171
00:11:01,279 --> 00:11:01,759
Yes.

172
00:11:01,759 --> 00:11:03,220
No need to see me out.

173
00:11:03,260 --> 00:11:04,360
If you ever need anything,

174
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,919
- just come to me.
- All right.

175
00:11:05,919 --> 00:11:06,720
Take care.

176
00:11:11,039 --> 00:11:11,919
Look,

177
00:11:11,976 --> 00:11:13,870
we spent money
and still couldn't get it done,

178
00:11:13,879 --> 00:11:16,240
but our Lanxiang
didn't spend a single coin

179
00:11:16,279 --> 00:11:17,559
and got it done for us.

180
00:11:17,559 --> 00:11:18,360
It's cold outside.

181
00:11:18,399 --> 00:11:19,600
Let's hurry back in.

182
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:23,600
We can finally sleep well tonight.

183
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:38,780
(Rongbao Pavilion)

184
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:53,096
Young Master.

185
00:11:56,679 --> 00:11:57,320
Young Master.

186
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:00,679
Shopkeeper Xu.

187
00:12:04,799 --> 00:12:06,159
You were the one who acquired

188
00:12:06,728 --> 00:12:08,240
Li Yingqiu's Cold Mountain Painting?

189
00:12:08,559 --> 00:12:09,720
I was just lucky.

190
00:12:11,144 --> 00:12:13,840
Young Master, would you like to see
some paintings and calligraphy,

191
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:16,039
or perhaps some porcelain and jade?

192
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,480
The account books.

193
00:12:25,960 --> 00:12:26,759
Young Master,

194
00:12:26,799 --> 00:12:28,080
this way, please.

195
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:35,360
Get back to work.

196
00:13:06,759 --> 00:13:07,519
Young Master,

197
00:13:07,600 --> 00:13:10,440
since Qingxiang married
and moved to the capital,

198
00:13:10,639 --> 00:13:12,080
Zijin has taken over

199
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:14,279
the money and accounts.

200
00:13:14,840 --> 00:13:16,159
Zijin

201
00:13:16,639 --> 00:13:18,519
can neither read nor do accounts.

202
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,039
So whenever she comes,

203
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:21,879
she doesn't check anything in person

204
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,879
and simply takes everything away.

205
00:13:24,559 --> 00:13:25,320
However,

206
00:13:26,159 --> 00:13:28,399
I noticed that Zijin

207
00:13:28,679 --> 00:13:30,039
has an account book.

208
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,279
Someone must be keeping the accounts.

209
00:13:35,279 --> 00:13:36,519
What's recorded inside?

210
00:13:37,559 --> 00:13:39,000
I didn't dare look too closely.

211
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:42,840
But I run an antique shop,

212
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:45,159
so I look at inscriptions
and seals every day.

213
00:13:45,759 --> 00:13:46,519
That's why

214
00:13:46,679 --> 00:13:49,600
I immediately
noticed a seal mark inside.

215
00:13:50,424 --> 00:13:51,544
I was afraid I'd forget it,

216
00:13:51,679 --> 00:13:54,039
so I quickly sketched it.

217
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:57,519
It's not an exact copy,

218
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:59,840
but it's about seventy
or eighty percent accurate.

219
00:14:16,620 --> 00:14:19,780
(Gold)

220
00:14:23,768 --> 00:14:25,250
It's one of a matching pair of seals.

221
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:28,559
You have a keen eye, Young Master.

222
00:14:29,200 --> 00:14:30,639
It is indeed one of a matching pair.

223
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,200
From my experience,

224
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,960
the person keeping the accounts

225
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:36,279
should have one seal,

226
00:14:36,519 --> 00:14:37,519
while Young Madam

227
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,919
has the other.

228
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:42,200
That way,

229
00:14:42,559 --> 00:14:44,200
the two of them don't need to meet.

230
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:45,440
They can use the seals

231
00:14:45,919 --> 00:14:47,759
to verify the receipt
of money and goods.

232
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,080
Well done.

233
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:57,799
These past few days,

234
00:14:57,879 --> 00:15:00,120
I've followed
your instructions closely, Young Master,

235
00:15:00,159 --> 00:15:01,320
and kept everything as usual.

236
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:03,840
Young Madam hasn't suspected a thing.

237
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:06,759
But today,

238
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,200
if you make this visit,

239
00:15:09,919 --> 00:15:11,240
I'm afraid we won't be able

240
00:15:11,250 --> 00:15:12,648
to keep it from Young Madam anymore.

241
00:15:15,039 --> 00:15:17,799
Then there's no need to hide it.

242
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,600
You're right, Young Master.

243
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:37,000
Are you cold?

244
00:15:38,279 --> 00:15:38,759
No.

245
00:15:39,032 --> 00:15:41,000
I'm wearing the padded jacket
my mother made me,

246
00:15:41,064 --> 00:15:42,320
with fresh silk floss inside,

247
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:43,600
and thick socks too.

248
00:15:43,879 --> 00:15:44,759
I'm very warm.

249
00:15:45,816 --> 00:15:46,910
Thank your mother for me.

250
00:15:47,279 --> 00:15:48,759
Your parents really do cherish you.

251
00:15:49,519 --> 00:15:50,879
My parents do cherish me.

252
00:15:51,096 --> 00:15:53,320
My mother
and grandmother cherish me, too.

253
00:15:53,519 --> 00:15:54,000
Look.

254
00:15:54,088 --> 00:15:55,510
My grandmother just made this for me.

255
00:15:56,072 --> 00:15:57,048
My mother also said

256
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:59,000
to thank you
for looking after me, a silly girl.

257
00:16:19,919 --> 00:16:20,960
Please let us pass.

258
00:16:22,399 --> 00:16:25,159
What brings you two precious ladies

259
00:16:25,159 --> 00:16:26,559
to fetch water yourselves today?

260
00:16:26,632 --> 00:16:28,670
What if you bump
into something and hurt yourselves?

261
00:16:28,919 --> 00:16:30,200
If Young Master blames us,

262
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,360
what would we do?

263
00:16:32,039 --> 00:16:32,600
You...

264
00:16:33,399 --> 00:16:34,879
What nonsense are you talking about?

265
00:16:36,088 --> 00:16:37,750
Young Madam needs the water urgently.

266
00:16:38,159 --> 00:16:39,200
Please let us pass.

267
00:16:43,720 --> 00:16:45,639
Why is there a toad in the water?

268
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:48,200
What toad?

269
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,879
Isn't this a toad right here?

270
00:16:54,879 --> 00:16:56,360
You're the toad.

271
00:16:56,639 --> 00:16:58,080
At least I don't shamelessly

272
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,759
dream of reaching for a swan.

273
00:17:02,799 --> 00:17:03,600
Lucao,

274
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,839
may I ask who the swan is?

275
00:17:10,799 --> 00:17:12,799
It doesn't matter if you call us toads,

276
00:17:13,240 --> 00:17:14,319
but if someone hears

277
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:16,359
that you compared
our master to an animal,

278
00:17:16,792 --> 00:17:18,790
I'm afraid it won't
end well for either of us.

279
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:29,200
Please let us pass.

280
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:55,440
♪The strings sound
as tales of family life are told♪

281
00:17:58,440 --> 00:18:16,640
♪In the Lion Grove
lives a family of officials♪

282
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:22,400
♪Second Master Yang
serves as an official♪

283
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:30,440
♪He pays no heed to matters at home♪

284
00:18:34,200 --> 00:18:40,279
♪Leaving his lovely wife neglected♪

285
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:51,319
♪How could she
not be filled with sorrow?♪

286
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,400
♪Sister-in-law♪

287
00:18:57,079 --> 00:19:01,319
♪I truly cannot drink any more♪

288
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:04,200
♪Brother♪

289
00:19:04,640 --> 00:19:06,240
♪Have a few more cups♪

290
00:19:06,799 --> 00:19:08,799
♪It will do no harm♪

291
00:19:12,519 --> 00:19:15,599
♪Why are heaven
and earth both spinning?♪

292
00:19:16,319 --> 00:19:22,119
♪I mistake my sister-in-law
for my beloved♪

293
00:19:29,440 --> 00:19:32,359
♪Anger rises in my heart♪

294
00:19:33,119 --> 00:19:37,920
♪And evil grows within me♪

295
00:19:38,920 --> 00:19:44,960
♪The more I think about it,
the less I can bear it♪

296
00:19:45,720 --> 00:19:49,119
♪Today, I, Second Master Yang♪

297
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:56,000
♪Will settle matters
with this adulterous woman♪

298
00:19:57,960 --> 00:19:58,720
Shut up!

299
00:20:00,559 --> 00:20:01,720
What kind of song is that?

300
00:20:03,560 --> 00:20:06,670
Young Madam, you said you wanted to hear
what's popular among the common folk,

301
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:07,768
whether refined or vulgar.

302
00:20:33,400 --> 00:20:35,200
I'm not feeling well today.

303
00:20:35,440 --> 00:20:36,480
It's giving me a headache.

304
00:20:37,160 --> 00:20:38,160
You may all leave.

305
00:20:40,039 --> 00:20:40,839
Xiaolian,

306
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:42,319
see the storyteller out first.

307
00:20:52,880 --> 00:20:53,680
My Lady,

308
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,830
it must have been scorched
by the foot warmer

309
00:20:55,880 --> 00:20:57,359
when it fell just now.

310
00:21:02,960 --> 00:21:03,880
Lanxiang,

311
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:25,319
I heard your mother
used to work in the sewing room.

312
00:21:26,359 --> 00:21:28,039
You must be
quite good at needlework, too.

313
00:21:28,599 --> 00:21:31,079
This silver fox fur
is one of my favorites.

314
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:33,799
Take it back and mend it for me.

315
00:21:36,400 --> 00:21:37,480
If you do a good job,

316
00:21:38,160 --> 00:21:39,400
I'll naturally reward you.

317
00:21:40,119 --> 00:21:41,440
If you don't,

318
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:43,359
I'll certainly punish you.

319
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,599
Why aren't you saying anything?

320
00:21:56,400 --> 00:21:58,000
Are you unwilling to do it?

321
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:00,920
Young Madam,

322
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:04,359
I was thinking
about how best to mend it.

323
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:08,319
Look, Young Madam.

324
00:22:08,960 --> 00:22:11,200
The damaged part is along the hem.

325
00:22:11,519 --> 00:22:13,640
Why not trim the edge

326
00:22:13,680 --> 00:22:15,240
with purple sable tails?

327
00:22:15,720 --> 00:22:16,880
Silver fox with purple sable

328
00:22:16,936 --> 00:22:18,400
would be distinctive and beautiful.

329
00:22:18,559 --> 00:22:21,359
There surely wouldn't
be another like it in Jinling City.

330
00:22:28,872 --> 00:22:29,368
Young Madam,

331
00:22:29,370 --> 00:22:31,710
these are the new fabrics
that just arrived at Jinxiu House.

332
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:33,359
The shopkeeper
had them sent over for you.

333
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:34,759
And this month's accounts

334
00:22:34,799 --> 00:22:35,960
were sent along with them.

335
00:22:37,380 --> 00:22:39,780
(Jinxiu House Account Book)

336
00:22:51,359 --> 00:22:52,440
Take them back for now.

337
00:22:52,640 --> 00:22:53,839
I'll look at them tonight.

338
00:22:55,440 --> 00:22:56,160
Yes.

339
00:23:03,519 --> 00:23:06,880
What you said
about silver fox and purple sable

340
00:23:08,039 --> 00:23:09,400
does sound rather distinctive.

341
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:11,480
Can you really do it?

342
00:23:13,032 --> 00:23:15,450
I've been doing needlework
with my mother since I was little.

343
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:17,400
I'm fairly confident I can.

344
00:23:18,599 --> 00:23:20,039
Then you'd better be careful.

345
00:23:20,799 --> 00:23:22,559
You can't be off
by even the slightest bit.

346
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:52,640
(Young Madam.)

347
00:23:52,720 --> 00:23:55,192
(These are the new fabrics
that just arrived at Jinxiu House.)

348
00:23:55,559 --> 00:23:56,960
(And this month's accounts)

349
00:23:56,960 --> 00:23:58,160
(were sent along with them.)

350
00:24:05,320 --> 00:24:06,936
(This is one of the matching seals.)

351
00:24:08,799 --> 00:24:10,759
But why is there nothing engraved on it?

352
00:24:11,839 --> 00:24:14,240
This is a dowry gift
I had specially made for you.

353
00:24:14,872 --> 00:24:16,632
It's called
a pair of mandarin duck seals.

354
00:24:16,792 --> 00:24:18,392
When the characters are engraved,

355
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:20,000
one seal is carved in relief,

356
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:21,440
and the other in intaglio,

357
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:24,759
symbolizing the harmony of yin and yang

358
00:24:24,880 --> 00:24:26,079
and two hearts as one.

359
00:24:27,200 --> 00:24:28,599
Once you marry into the Lin family,

360
00:24:28,759 --> 00:24:30,880
you and your husband
can each keep one seal.

361
00:24:32,160 --> 00:24:33,480
As for what characters to engrave,

362
00:24:34,440 --> 00:24:36,200
the two of you
can decide for yourselves.

363
00:24:37,559 --> 00:24:38,400
Mother.

364
00:24:40,759 --> 00:24:41,480
Lanxiang.

365
00:24:42,759 --> 00:24:43,519
Lanxiang.

366
00:24:46,039 --> 00:24:47,039
Lanxiang!

367
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:50,720
Let me tell you.

368
00:24:50,759 --> 00:24:53,160
The opera today was so good.

369
00:24:53,672 --> 00:24:56,240
It's a shame Young Madam had
a headache and didn't hear the rest.

370
00:25:00,759 --> 00:25:03,160
Do you want to know
what happened afterward?

371
00:25:06,119 --> 00:25:07,079
What happened?

372
00:25:08,119 --> 00:25:09,680
When I saw the storyteller out,

373
00:25:09,880 --> 00:25:11,359
she told me everything.

374
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:14,599
Later, Second Master Yang killed
the adulterous pair with one slash.

375
00:25:14,920 --> 00:25:16,480
Then, fearing the scandal would spread

376
00:25:16,599 --> 00:25:17,559
and disgrace his family,

377
00:25:17,920 --> 00:25:21,720
he killed several of the older maids
and young maids in the household, too.

378
00:25:25,079 --> 00:25:25,559
Yang...

379
00:25:34,359 --> 00:25:37,039
I was startled
when I first heard it, too.

380
00:25:37,759 --> 00:25:38,839
The storyteller said

381
00:25:38,840 --> 00:25:41,180
when the madam of the house
commits such a disgraceful act,

382
00:25:41,190 --> 00:25:42,590
the servants who attend her closely,

383
00:25:42,600 --> 00:25:45,079
whether they truly knew nothing
or merely claimed not to,

384
00:25:45,240 --> 00:25:46,839
could hardly escape death.

385
00:25:57,079 --> 00:25:57,880
Lanxiang.

386
00:25:58,519 --> 00:25:59,440
Lanxiang.

387
00:26:00,599 --> 00:26:01,400
What's wrong?

388
00:26:01,599 --> 00:26:02,759
Did that scare you?

389
00:26:05,839 --> 00:26:06,559
Yes.

390
00:26:07,039 --> 00:26:08,759
You keep talking about people dying.

391
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:10,839
It's making me uneasy.

392
00:26:12,640 --> 00:26:13,279
All right.

393
00:26:13,400 --> 00:26:14,279
I won't say any more.

394
00:26:17,279 --> 00:26:19,559
Just imagine, the blade was this big.

395
00:26:20,519 --> 00:26:22,839
One slash
with that would be so dangerous.

396
00:26:27,759 --> 00:26:30,160
I can't even
tell this part was burned.

397
00:26:31,032 --> 00:26:32,790
Young Madam,
would you like to try it on?

398
00:26:45,680 --> 00:26:46,519
It's beautiful.

399
00:26:46,568 --> 00:26:48,550
There truly isn't
another like it in Jinling City.

400
00:26:49,039 --> 00:26:51,319
Only you could carry off
such splendor, Young Madam.

401
00:27:02,319 --> 00:27:03,039
Not bad.

402
00:27:04,039 --> 00:27:05,759
I can see you
put a lot of thought into it.

403
00:27:06,640 --> 00:27:07,960
I should naturally do my utmost

404
00:27:08,000 --> 00:27:09,400
when serving Young Madam.

405
00:27:12,720 --> 00:27:13,599
Young Master is here.

406
00:27:13,640 --> 00:27:15,079
Quickly prepare some hot tea for him.

407
00:27:18,200 --> 00:27:18,960
Young Master.

408
00:27:19,279 --> 00:27:20,000
Young Master.

409
00:27:20,279 --> 00:27:22,079
Young Madam is resting inside.

410
00:27:40,920 --> 00:27:41,960
No wonder

411
00:27:41,960 --> 00:27:43,848
the northwest wind
howled all night yesterday.

412
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:45,640
It sounded like ghosts wailing.

413
00:27:46,400 --> 00:27:49,400
I wondered what was causing
such a commotion.

414
00:27:49,480 --> 00:27:51,599
So that's what
blew you here, Young Master.

415
00:27:55,000 --> 00:27:57,680
I need your help with something today.

416
00:27:58,839 --> 00:28:00,240
Now that's a rarity.

417
00:28:01,079 --> 00:28:02,240
Go on, Young Master.

418
00:28:02,264 --> 00:28:03,688
What do you need my help with?

419
00:28:07,799 --> 00:28:10,079
I have a squad leader under my command

420
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:11,319
named Du Zheng.

421
00:28:11,512 --> 00:28:13,768
When we fought the Japanese
pirates the year before last,

422
00:28:13,839 --> 00:28:15,079
he took a blow meant for me.

423
00:28:16,079 --> 00:28:17,119
When I returned to Jinling,

424
00:28:17,599 --> 00:28:19,319
I had him transferred back from Jinzhou

425
00:28:19,448 --> 00:28:20,840
and promoted to company commander.

426
00:28:21,839 --> 00:28:22,920
He has no parents

427
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:25,240
and only a younger sister
who depends on him.

428
00:28:27,000 --> 00:28:28,319
She has nowhere to go now.

429
00:28:29,208 --> 00:28:30,880
I've already
obtained Mother's permission

430
00:28:31,319 --> 00:28:33,799
to let her move into
the Lin Residence and stay here.

431
00:28:37,880 --> 00:28:39,440
Since First Madam has already agreed,

432
00:28:39,920 --> 00:28:41,319
I'll see to it.

433
00:28:44,440 --> 00:28:45,880
Luxue Lodge is vacant.

434
00:28:46,559 --> 00:28:48,319
Young Lady Du can stay there.

435
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:51,680
As for her food,
clothing, and other expenses,

436
00:28:51,800 --> 00:28:54,088
she'll be treated the same
as one of our own young ladies.

437
00:28:54,640 --> 00:28:56,039
We mustn't let anyone say

438
00:28:56,359 --> 00:28:58,119
the Lin family
has slighted our benefactor.

439
00:29:01,010 --> 00:29:02,880
I think Luxue Lodge
is the most suitable, too.

440
00:29:05,528 --> 00:29:07,640
It's just that the place
has been vacant for so long

441
00:29:07,640 --> 00:29:09,752
and needs some repairs
before anyone can live there.

442
00:29:11,480 --> 00:29:12,240
As for the money...

443
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:16,599
Young Master's benefactor

444
00:29:17,039 --> 00:29:18,559
is also a benefactor of the Lin family.

445
00:29:20,119 --> 00:29:22,279
It should naturally
come from the family funds.

446
00:29:25,079 --> 00:29:26,279
Then please stamp your seal.

447
00:29:26,600 --> 00:29:28,590
I'll have Jiugao
collect the money right away

448
00:29:28,776 --> 00:29:30,344
and hire craftsmen to begin the work.

449
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:32,740
Let's get her settled
in before the Chinese New Year

450
00:29:32,759 --> 00:29:34,319
so she won't have to spend it all alone.

451
00:29:46,279 --> 00:29:48,759
Young Master is truly thoughtful.

452
00:29:51,279 --> 00:29:52,039
Zijin.

453
00:29:52,799 --> 00:29:54,079
Bring me my seal.

454
00:30:09,519 --> 00:30:11,160
There are so many seals in there.

455
00:30:11,920 --> 00:30:13,559
I don't know which one it is.

456
00:30:14,720 --> 00:30:16,599
You're utterly useless.

457
00:30:47,880 --> 00:30:48,680
Young Madam.

458
00:30:54,599 --> 00:30:55,599
The craftsmen can't read

459
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:56,710
and won't accept banknotes.

460
00:30:56,720 --> 00:30:58,190
They want payment entirely in silver.

461
00:30:58,200 --> 00:31:00,170
Do you need to ask me
about such a trivial matter?

462
00:31:00,280 --> 00:31:02,120
Get it from
the accounts office, of course.

463
00:31:02,300 --> 00:31:04,300
(Lin Jiugao)

464
00:31:35,759 --> 00:31:36,599
Zijin.

465
00:32:10,359 --> 00:32:11,359
I've picked them all up.

466
00:32:12,039 --> 00:32:13,240
Luckily, none of them broke.

467
00:32:23,039 --> 00:32:24,279
My Lady...

468
00:32:35,192 --> 00:32:36,184
I'll leave you to it.

469
00:32:36,376 --> 00:32:37,710
I still have things to attend to.

470
00:32:37,720 --> 00:32:38,319
I'll be going.

471
00:32:39,359 --> 00:32:40,279
I won't see you out.

472
00:32:51,680 --> 00:32:53,480
If Young Madam
has no other instructions,

473
00:32:53,519 --> 00:32:54,519
I'll take my leave.

474
00:32:57,200 --> 00:32:57,960
Go.

475
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:18,240
Where's my seal?

476
00:33:18,880 --> 00:33:20,200
Did Jiugao steal it?

477
00:33:20,680 --> 00:33:21,759
Did he?

478
00:33:21,960 --> 00:33:22,960
I don't know.

479
00:33:23,519 --> 00:33:24,319
I'll look again.

480
00:33:24,559 --> 00:33:25,400
I'll look again.

481
00:33:27,864 --> 00:33:28,400
My Lady!

482
00:33:28,559 --> 00:33:29,160
My Lady!

483
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:30,119
It's all my fault.

484
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:31,079
I was careless.

485
00:33:31,200 --> 00:33:31,720
My Lady!

486
00:33:32,759 --> 00:33:33,799
Useless fool.

487
00:33:33,799 --> 00:33:34,400
My Lady!

488
00:33:34,559 --> 00:33:36,200
It's all my fault. It's all my fault!

489
00:33:36,240 --> 00:33:37,440
You're useless at everything.

490
00:33:38,039 --> 00:33:39,200
Hurry up and look for it!

491
00:33:46,240 --> 00:33:47,000
My Lady.

492
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:49,759
My Lady.

493
00:33:50,319 --> 00:33:51,279
My Lady!

494
00:33:51,680 --> 00:33:53,000
What are you shrieking about?

495
00:33:56,319 --> 00:33:56,920
My Lady...

496
00:33:57,279 --> 00:33:58,319
The seal...

497
00:34:14,480 --> 00:34:16,400
Could this place be haunted?

498
00:34:17,599 --> 00:34:19,559
Haunted in broad daylight?

499
00:34:20,599 --> 00:34:21,679
You can't even measure up

500
00:34:21,679 --> 00:34:23,239
to half of Qingxiang.

501
00:34:23,400 --> 00:34:24,679
Then how did it suddenly

502
00:34:24,679 --> 00:34:26,239
appear right under our noses?

503
00:34:44,239 --> 00:34:45,039
It wasn't a ghost.

504
00:34:45,840 --> 00:34:46,599
It was this.

505
00:34:49,880 --> 00:34:50,480
The fox...

506
00:34:51,110 --> 00:34:52,744
The Fox Immortal has revealed itself!

507
00:34:56,320 --> 00:34:57,400
Look carefully.

508
00:35:28,119 --> 00:35:31,440
So it was wrapped up
in the silver fox fur.

509
00:35:32,360 --> 00:35:33,440
No wonder, when I

510
00:35:33,510 --> 00:35:35,464
accidentally dropped
the silver fox fur just now,

511
00:35:35,639 --> 00:35:36,679
it rolled out.

512
00:35:42,760 --> 00:35:45,119
They say the Lin family
brings me nothing but trouble,

513
00:35:48,840 --> 00:35:49,920
but this Lanxiang

514
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:53,119
has helped me greatly by sheer chance.

515
00:35:54,199 --> 00:35:55,800
Take a silver ring you don't like

516
00:35:57,639 --> 00:35:58,480
and say

517
00:35:59,519 --> 00:36:01,320
it's a reward from Young Madam

518
00:36:01,679 --> 00:36:04,039
for mending the silver fox fur so well.

519
00:36:05,199 --> 00:36:06,079
Yes.

520
00:36:35,719 --> 00:36:36,920
(Then please stamp your seal.)

521
00:36:37,519 --> 00:36:38,760
(Bring me my seal.)

522
00:36:49,840 --> 00:36:50,599
Young Madam.

523
00:36:52,104 --> 00:36:54,584
(When the madam of the house
commits such a disgraceful act,)

524
00:36:54,590 --> 00:36:56,100
(the servants who attend her closely,)

525
00:36:56,119 --> 00:36:58,559
(whether they truly knew nothing
or merely claimed not to,)

526
00:36:58,840 --> 00:37:00,280
(could hardly escape death.)

527
00:37:08,480 --> 00:37:09,400
Zijin.

528
00:37:51,620 --> 00:37:55,540
(Money)

529
00:38:10,599 --> 00:38:11,800
(Young Madam loves money.)

530
00:38:12,088 --> 00:38:13,480
(The person keeping the accounts)

531
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:15,199
(should be a woman,)

532
00:38:15,920 --> 00:38:17,079
(just like Qingxiang.)

533
00:38:19,320 --> 00:38:20,680
(Gold)
The character for "gold".

534
00:38:20,710 --> 00:38:22,472
Young Master,
why do you keep staring at it?

535
00:38:23,559 --> 00:38:25,199
It looks like the character for "gold",

536
00:38:27,880 --> 00:38:29,590
but if Huang Youzhi
didn't see it clearly

537
00:38:29,599 --> 00:38:30,960
in his haste,

538
00:38:31,800 --> 00:38:34,280
and the final stroke slanted upward,

539
00:38:36,880 --> 00:38:38,440
then it would only be a radical.

540
00:38:40,119 --> 00:38:41,599
Young Madam loves silver so much.

541
00:38:41,800 --> 00:38:43,130
Using the character
for "money" on her matching seals

542
00:38:43,144 --> 00:38:44,296
would suit her perfectly.

543
00:38:46,280 --> 00:38:47,360
You think

544
00:38:48,360 --> 00:38:49,599
it's the character for "money"?

545
00:38:54,239 --> 00:38:54,960
I...

546
00:38:56,039 --> 00:38:57,760
was just making a wild guess.

547
00:38:58,559 --> 00:38:59,719
It could be "copper"

548
00:39:00,280 --> 00:39:01,280
or perhaps "blade".

549
00:39:02,239 --> 00:39:04,840
There are many characters
with the metal radical.

550
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:07,079
It doesn't have to be "money".

551
00:39:08,719 --> 00:39:10,639
Could it really
be the character for "money"?

552
00:39:14,920 --> 00:39:15,480
Young Master.

553
00:39:15,760 --> 00:39:16,600
I've looked into it.

554
00:39:17,360 --> 00:39:19,320
The day after you visited

555
00:39:19,559 --> 00:39:20,280
Rongbao Pavilion,

556
00:39:20,440 --> 00:39:22,239
Jinxiu House
sent fabrics to the residence.

557
00:39:23,039 --> 00:39:23,920
Two days later,

558
00:39:24,039 --> 00:39:25,360
Zijin went to Rongbao Pavilion

559
00:39:25,384 --> 00:39:27,848
and asked Huang Youzhi
about you checking the accounts.

560
00:39:28,400 --> 00:39:30,119
Huang Youzhi said
he hadn't said anything.

561
00:39:31,840 --> 00:39:32,760
From the looks of it,

562
00:39:33,360 --> 00:39:34,760
Jinxiu House may well

563
00:39:36,639 --> 00:39:38,320
be tipping Young Madam off.

564
00:39:42,199 --> 00:39:44,920
Jinxiu House was part
of Young Madam's dowry.

565
00:39:46,360 --> 00:39:47,440
Every month, Young Madam

566
00:39:47,544 --> 00:39:49,190
visits her shops to check the accounts.

567
00:39:50,039 --> 00:39:53,599
She visits Jinxiu House most often.

568
00:39:58,280 --> 00:39:59,199
What a coincidence.

569
00:40:01,599 --> 00:40:02,599
It seems

570
00:40:03,679 --> 00:40:05,199
we need to investigate

571
00:40:05,719 --> 00:40:06,840
Jinxiu House.

572
00:40:11,144 --> 00:40:14,180
(Gold)

573
00:40:39,064 --> 00:40:40,824
Young Master
is investigating the accounts.

574
00:40:41,440 --> 00:40:44,840
Young Madam, perhaps you
shouldn't go to Jinxiu House.

575
00:40:45,656 --> 00:40:47,128
No matter how much he investigates,

576
00:40:47,920 --> 00:40:50,280
he won't find his way
into the accounts of my dowry shops.

577
00:40:52,800 --> 00:40:53,559
Besides,

578
00:40:54,040 --> 00:40:56,639
even if he finds out I've been
making usurious loans, so what?

579
00:40:58,280 --> 00:41:00,880
If he's capable, he can divorce me.

580
00:41:01,519 --> 00:41:02,719
I'd be more than happy.

581
00:41:18,024 --> 00:41:20,312
You two have been
in the residence for quite some time,

582
00:41:20,344 --> 00:41:22,392
but neither of you
has ever gone out with me.

583
00:41:22,920 --> 00:41:24,440
Who wants to go out today?

584
00:41:39,760 --> 00:41:41,719
Young Madam, I do.

585
00:41:47,519 --> 00:41:48,679
Nanny Feng, Lanxiang,

586
00:41:49,880 --> 00:41:51,039
come with me.

587
00:42:04,620 --> 00:42:07,740
(Jinxiu House)

588
00:42:29,880 --> 00:42:30,400
Young Madam.

589
00:42:30,400 --> 00:42:31,719
(Liu Sande,
Head Shopkeeper of Jinxiu House)

590
00:42:31,720 --> 00:42:32,504
Please come inside.

591
00:42:35,840 --> 00:42:37,719
This is one
of Young Madam's dowry shops.

592
00:42:37,816 --> 00:42:39,992
Young Madam comes once
a month to check the accounts.

593
00:42:40,040 --> 00:42:42,280
To avoid disturbing
the customers and affecting business,

594
00:42:42,320 --> 00:42:44,350
she always enters
and leaves through the back door.

595
00:42:44,360 --> 00:42:45,912
Thank you for teaching me, Madam Feng.

596
00:42:50,480 --> 00:42:52,199
Madam Feng, Lanxiang,

597
00:42:52,679 --> 00:42:53,920
wait downstairs.

598
00:42:54,440 --> 00:42:55,079
- Yes.
- Yes.

599
00:42:55,920 --> 00:42:56,679
Shopkeeper Liu.

600
00:42:57,144 --> 00:42:58,190
Go tell Young Lady Qian

601
00:42:58,239 --> 00:42:59,719
to bring all the account books.

602
00:43:05,260 --> 00:43:07,740
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

603
00:43:10,440 --> 00:43:11,519
Be my ears

604
00:43:12,519 --> 00:43:13,320
and eyes.

605
00:43:14,360 --> 00:43:15,240
Everything you hear

606
00:43:15,288 --> 00:43:17,670
and see while you're with Zhao Xingtang,

607
00:43:18,239 --> 00:43:19,199
report it all to me.

608
00:43:20,880 --> 00:43:22,320
If you do this well,

609
00:43:23,639 --> 00:43:24,679
I guarantee

610
00:43:27,352 --> 00:43:28,670
your whole family will be safe.

611
00:43:49,620 --> 00:43:53,740
